sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant API as apps/api (RunsController)
  participant Redis

  Client->>API: POST /api/v1/runs/:runId/cancel (cancelRun)
  Note right of API: apps/api/src/api/runs.controller.ts:455-584 cancelRun
  API->>API: CancelRunSchema.parse
  alt Valid runId & run exists & tenant OK
    API->>Redis: get run:runId
    API->>API: status=failed, endedAt, add cancel step
    API->>Redis: setex run:runId JSON
    API->>API: cancelQueuedJobs(runId)
    API-->>Client: 200 { run }
  else Invalid UUID
    API-->>Client: 400 INVALID_RUN_ID
  else Not Found
    API-->>Client: 404 RUN_NOT_FOUND
  else Tenant Denied
    API-->>Client: 403 TENANT_ACCESS_DENIED
  else Not Cancellable
    API-->>Client: 400 RUN_NOT_CANCELLABLE
  end
  opt Internal Failure
    API-->>Client: 500 INTERNAL_ERROR
  end
